EAAC4AJ_yA\",\"type\":\"news\",\"tags\":[],\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"slug\":\"babel-returns-to-le-bon-marche-for-a-second-season\",\"first_publication_date\":\"2026-09-10T14:29:02+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-09-10T14:29:02+0000\",\"uid\":\"babel-returns-to-le-bon-marche-for-a-second-season\",\"data\":{\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"Babel returns to Le Bon Marché for a second season \",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"After dark, Le Bon Marché Rive Gauche becomes the setting for Babel, Mourad Merzouki’s choreography bringing together dance, circus and martial arts. \",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"coverImage\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2000,\"height\":1100},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a_CoverLBM.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2000,\"height\":1100},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a_CoverLBM.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2000,\"height\":1100},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a_CoverLBM.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2000,\"height\":1100},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a_CoverLBM.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ZiXj9ThVR3OyOF5a\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}}},\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"key\":\"606dcca7-d4e3-4356-b945-2d86658a3119\",\"isBroken\":false}},{\"item\":{\"id\":\"aqErGhEAACoAJcwf\",\"type\":\"news\",\"tags\":[],\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"slug\":\"kenzo-parfums-connects-creation-and-conservation-with-leau-ambree\",\"first_publication_date\":\"2026-09-09T14:39:32+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-09-09T16:06:42+0000\",\"uid\":\"kenzo-parfums-connects-creation-and-conservation-with-leau-ambree\",\"data\":{\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"Kenzo Parfums connects creation and conservation with L’Eau Ambrée\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"L’Eau Ambrée, a new interpretation of L’Eau Kenzo, brings a warmer, more sensual dimension to the iconic fragrance. Inspired by an ocean warmed by the last rays of sunlight, it combines natural-origin ingredients with thoughtful choices in sourcing and production, reflecting Kenzo Parfums’ commitment to creating with greater consideration for the environment.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"coverImage\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2840,\"height\":1594},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-09-09%C3%A011.51.09.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2840,\"height\":1594},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-09-09%C3%A011.51.09.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2840,\"height\":1594},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-09-09%C3%A011.51.09.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2840,\"height\":1594},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-09-09%C3%A011.51.09.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"r1nSv2sik6KzCeRs\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}}},\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"key\":\"13f25d86-e082-4ddc-92fa-f46f2d3778d8\",\"isBroken\":false}},{\"item\":{\"id\":\"ap_yOhEAAC0AI7t9\",\"type\":\"news\",\"tags\":[],\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"slug\":\"bvlgari-brings-kaleidos-to-shanghai\",\"first_publication_date\":\"2026-09-08T14:32:22+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-09-08T14:32:22+0000\",\"uid\":\"bvlgari-brings-kaleidos-to-shanghai\",\"data\":{\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"Bvlgari brings Kaleidos to Shanghai \",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Following its international debut, Bvlgari's Kaleidos: Colors, Cultures and Crafts exhibition arrives in Shanghai for a new chapter at the Power Station of Art, the first public museum of contemporary art in mainland China.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"coverImage\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":3500,\"height\":2333},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/izPWmqLNpNPXD1e6_bvlgari_kaleidosshanghai_DSC0452.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"izPWmqLNpNPXD1e6\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":3500,\"height\":2333},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/izPWmqLNpNPXD1e6_bvlgari_kaleidosshanghai_DSC0452.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"izPWmqLNpNPXD1e6\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":3500,\"height\":2333},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/izPWmqLNpNPXD1e6_bvlgari_kaleidosshanghai_DSC0452.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"izPWmqLNpNPX